  "stem": "<p>The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 4 x Superscript negative 1\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 21 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced></math>?</p>",
